WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.755
Choose between lists, tuples and dictionaries for real tasks.

00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:08.535
A dictionary provides an intuitive name-to-score mapping.

00:00:09.535 --> 00:00:13.915
Which operation removes the most recently added item from a list-based stack?

00:00:13.915 --> 00:00:17.565
pop() without an index removes and returns the last item.
